@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/hanoi#> .
@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix reporting: <http://example.org/orexis/reporting#> .

#  The mover's PRIVATE beliefs — the two picks every agent owes: a patience, because it
#  holds a want and a want obliges one, and a reporting interval, because no agent may be
#  silent by construction. Nothing else: no cadences (nothing sensed), no conversions
#  (nothing poured), no market blocks (nothing bought).
:hanoi orexis:patienceS 60 .
#  And a budget, because the puzzle needs one: three disks solve in 50 worlds with the want's
#  own estimate, and the engine's default is sized for a plant, not for a tower.
:hanoi orexis:budgetWorlds 64 .
:hanoi reporting:metricsIntervalS 60 .
